  "body": "SchemaCrawler  release at last commit 9b99edf0f2030a6f13f7335a8f841348028bc89a\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Remove catalog name by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2529\n* Use JDK 25 for Docker image by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2530\n* Rework named object indexes for performance by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2535\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.6.40 to 1.6.41 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2534\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 4.38.3 to 4.39.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2533\n* Bump com.ing.data:cassandra-jdbc-wrapper from 5.0.3 to 5.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2531\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 4.39.0 to 4.39.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2538\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.6.41 to 1.7.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2537\n* Bump com.clickhouse:clickhouse-jdbc from 0.10.0 to 0.11.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2536\n* Update compare test results by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2539\n* Add manifests to jar, and reduce places where version is specified by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2540\n* v18.0.1 by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2541\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v17.16.0...v18.0.1",
